)\r\n> \r\n> Scene: \"res://World_StressTest.tscn\"\r\n> \r\n> Before this patch ([0fdbf05](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/0fdbf050e0c7fc7e0a9d42c2a41ee3bfdffbd8f1))\r\n> \r\n> FPS: high 89, low 86, median 88 MSPF: high 11.62, low 11.23, median 11.36\r\n> \r\n> After:\r\n> \r\n> FPS: high 122, low 119, median 121 MSPF: high 8.40, low 8.19, median 8.26\r\n> \r\n> median FPS change: +33 (+37.50%) median MSPF change: -3.10 (-27.29%)\r\n> \r\n> Scene: \"res://World.tscn\"\r\n> \r\n> Before this patch ([0fdbf05](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/0fdbf050e0c7fc7e0a9d42c2a41ee3bfdffbd8f1))\r\n> \r\n> FPS: high 176, low 170, median 175 MSPF: high 5.88, low 5.68, median 5.71\r\n> \r\n> After:\r\n> \r\n> FPS: high 351, low 330, median 347 MSPF: high 3.03, low 2.84, median 2.88\r\n> \r\n> median FPS change: +172 (+98.29%) median MSPF change: -2.83 (-49.56%)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4017230242/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4017306869","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116394#issuecomment-4017306869","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116394","id":4017306869,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7vczz1","user":{"login":"Ryan-000","id":73148864,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMTQ4ODY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73148864?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000","html_url":"https://github.com/Ryan-000","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-07T20:43:04Z","updated_at":"2026-03-07T20:43:04Z","body":"> Are the animations in this optimize project licensed such that they can be added to godot benchmarks?\r\n(If not, would it be possible to submit the example project and swap out the animations with my own CC0 animation set?)\r\n\r\nThe character and animations are from Mixamo, so I am not sure whether they can be redistributed publicly. So you may need to replace them with your own.\r\n\r\nOne note: the animation tree is a stripped-down version from one of my projects (private animation references were replaced by a T-pose). Because of that, many of the nodes are effectively placeholders and do not currently contribute meaningful behaviour. I wanted to mention that in case it matters for benchmark use.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4017306869/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4022832850","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116394#issuecomment-4022832850","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116394","id":4022832850,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7vx47S","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https: